是極黑咖哩豬拉麵\n我跟媽咪都有再加一份叉燒🤣\n\n極辣地獄拉麵--\n麵條Q彈不軟爛\n湯頭充滿濃濃的香辣味(店家特調的辣醬)\n大辣的辣味真的很過癮很香又夠味\n叉燒肉瘦肉比例雖多，但吃起來卻不柴\n店家很大方還讓客戶免費續一球麵\n（我跟媽咪都有再續😆）\n續的麵就是一開始端上桌的那種麵條而非細麵\n超級大方的啦~~\n而且店家還很是寵物友善店家\n帥氣老闆態度也相當親切\n（還記得第一次去吃的時候老闆還特別地跑過來跟我說3級的辣度非常辣，怕我吃了承受不了，建議我先吃level2的，不夠辣再跟他說，結果證實，我確實是大辣妹沒錯🤣）\n每一位店員服務態度也都相當平易近人\n這樣一碗才一百多元不到兩百元的超美味拉麵在物價貴的恐怖的台北市區實在是找不到了啦👍\n讓我跟媽咪每次享用完美味拉麵都感到意猶未盡🥰\n走過路過千萬不能錯過呀⭐️",null,[0,53]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5697700346149082569/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTlJOR1ZsYUY5blJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5697700346149082569/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTlJOR1ZsYUY5blJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5697700346149082569/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTlJOR1ZsYUY5blJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5697700346149082569/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTlJOR1ZsYUY5blJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5697700346149082569/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTlJOR1ZsYUY5blJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5697700346149082569/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTlJOR1ZsYUY5blJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,9857,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRNGVlaF9nRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xa22bff065146a435!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgMCQ4eeh_gE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRNGVlaF9nRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRNGVlaF9nRRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRNGVlaEFREhNDZ3dJc055ZXZnWVFnT3VzbEFNGi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdNQ1E0ZWVoZ1FFEhNDZ3dJc055ZXZnWVFnT3VzbEFNIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARNaRGUQb_K6IqCzBibHVza21Ybkwt\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjo4O3E9dmWAxUPn68BHYjSA7UQoykI_wEoFg"],null,[null,[[1,0